  "contract": [
    "Primordial Fury 806543 reads 'Your runic tattoos flare up for $d, causing Runeblade to strike up to $s3",
    "additional enemies. For the duration, your Runic Tattoos have $s1% increased effectiveness.' Duration index 8",
    "(15 s). Effect 0 is native ADD_PCT_MODIFIER SPELLMOD_ALL_EFFECTS +100% on family 38 masks 0x200004/mask2 0x22,",
    "which covers every Runic Tattoos rank (Earth 801094: mask0 0x400, mask2 0x4002); the tattoos are permanent auras,",
    "so AuraEffect::ApplySpellMod recalculates them when the modifier comes and goes. Effect 2 is native",
    "ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER SPELLMOD_JUMP_TARGETS +5 on mask2 0x40000, carried only by the Runeblade ranks; effect 1 is a",
    "0% damage modifier. The report's 'no handler' premise does not apply to native modifiers. Expected: while it",
    "lasts, Runic Tattoos: Earth gives +150 armor and +10 Nature resistance instead of +75/+5, a Runeblade cast at",
    "one of six clustered enemies hits five or six of them instead of one, and everything returns after 15 s.",
    "Runeblade has no chain targets of its own, so +5 jump targets means five enemies in total (four additional);",
    "Magic Etchings 520079 (+2, 'strikes 1 additional nearby target') follows the same count, while this tooltip",
    "says 'up to 5 additional'. That difference is left open, so both five and six are accepted."
  ],
